---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import UnitCircle from '../components/UnitCircle.astro';
import ToolCards from '../components/ToolCards.astro';
---
<Layout><div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">An open space for curious minds</div><h1>Math makes more sense<br/>when you can move it.</h1><p>Explore a shape. Change an angle. See the why behind the formula.</p></div><span class="intro-note">Your next “oh, I get it” starts here.</span></div><UnitCircle compact/><div class="below-bench"><span>Start exploring: drag the green point, or try a special angle.</span><a class="text-link" href="/unit-circle/">Explore the full unit circle ↗</a></div><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>A small toolkit. A world of discovery.</h2><p>Pick a question. Find your way to an answer.</p></div><span class="badge">BUILT FOR UNDERSTANDING</span></div><ToolCards/><div class="learning-strip"><div><h2>A formula is only the beginning.</h2><p>Put your understanding to work with a quick round of practice.</p></div><a href="/practice/">Try a practice round ↗</a></div></Layout>
